%% Lab 10: the desk agent as a LangGraph graph. The state (the messages list) enters at START; the model node calls the
%% model; our route function picks the next node; the tools node runs our lookups and the back edge loops to the model.
%% The dashed box marks where HumanInTheLoopMiddleware pauses before a write (Part F); the checkpointer saves the state
%% after every step (Parts F and G).
%% Export: npx -y @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli -i lab10_graph_by_hand.mmd -o lab10_graph_by_hand.png -b white -s 2
flowchart LR
    start([START<br/>state in:<br/>messages]) --> model[model node<br/>one call to the model,<br/>tools bound;<br/>appends its reply]
    model --> route{route, our Python:<br/>does the reply<br/>ask for tools?}
    route -->|yes| tools[tools node<br/>ToolNode runs<br/>each call;<br/>appends tool messages]
    tools -->|back edge| model
    route -->|no| finish([END<br/>state out:<br/>the answer last])
    pause[approval pause, Part F:<br/>a write waits here for<br/>approve, edit or reject] -.- route
    saver[(checkpointer:<br/>saves the state<br/>after every step)] -.- model
    classDef model fill:#0B1220,color:#FFFFFF,stroke:#0B1220
    classDef code fill:#C9F24D,color:#0B1220,stroke:#0B1220
    classDef note fill:#FFFFFF,color:#0B1220,stroke:#6B7383,stroke-dasharray:5 4
    class model model
    class route,tools code
    class pause,saver note
